  "requirements": [
    {
      "id": "R1",
      "summary": "Surface unclassified startup failures with a typed error.code and bounded optional startup_stage (snapshot_recovery, catalog_loop_start, catalog_loop_drain, listener_serve) emitted as exactly one startup_failed line per failing exit and none on graceful shutdown (nil-preserving wrap); snapshot-recovery quarantined-unrecoverable exits reclassify state_directory→snapshot_recovery as the single documented compatibility change (state_directory keeps its meaning for storage.Open failures); additive one-field envelope with schema_version 1 preserved and the field union 130→131 in lockstep across envelopeFieldNames, docs/logging-contract.md, internal/observe/log_test.go and the config_envelope_test.go count pin; full-path runContext tests prove one line + code + stage for catalog_loop_start, snapshot_recovery and listener_serve; genuine unknown stays internal_error; no secrets or raw error text."
    }
  ],
